    <abstract>
        <para>The dataset consists of points of registrations of mainly reptiles and amphibians (along with several mammalias, avian and insects&amp;#39; species) found within the territory of Rzhyshchiv city amalgamated territorieal community (CATC) (Kyiv region) during field research conducted in 2021. Several findings were collected from iNaturalist web site.</para>
    </abstract>
